        <briefdescription>
<para>Child nodes of this layout node. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Each child is represented by a shared pointer to another <ref refid="structfccvis_1_1scene_1_1meta_1_1LayoutNode" kindref="compound">LayoutNode</ref> together with an integer weight.</para>
<para>For <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacefccvis_1_1scene_1_1meta_1a017bf030c5651ecea05a747f42afba44a4492081ca02b059f9e8af4ddaf0f7292" kindref="member">LayoutKind::Pack</ref></computeroutput> nodes, the weight determines the child&apos;s relative share of the available layout space.</para>
<para>For <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacefccvis_1_1scene_1_1meta_1a017bf030c5651ecea05a747f42afba44a5c6ba25104401c9ee0650230fc6ba413" kindref="member">LayoutKind::Tab</ref></computeroutput> nodes, the weight is ignored.</para>
<para>Leaf nodes normally have no children. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
